---
description: Dashboard rules
globs: ["src/aurumspread/app/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Streamlit + Plotly. The UI only reads precomputed artifacts or calls pure functions; no business logic in UI files.
- Every displayed metric has a tooltip/expander showing its formula and source rows.
- Net-of-cost numbers are the default; gross is shown only alongside net.
- Alert view defaults to quiet: show "No actionable signal" when none pass LAMS. Never pad with fake alerts.
- Cache with `st.cache_data`; app must run fully offline from `data/processed`.
